From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jake Hoffman <122403457+jakethehoffer@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 21:10:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] plugins: register the QNX process and slog2 inputs

The two QNX-only inputs live outside the upstream tree and are copied in
before configure. Register them next to the other inputs so CMake builds
each one only when its FLB_IN_* option is on. Both stay off unless the
QNX build asks for them, so a build that has not turned an option on does
not look for a directory that is not there yet.

Signed-off-by: Jake Hoffman <122403457+jakethehoffer@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 plugins/CMakeLists.txt | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/plugins/CMakeLists.txt b/plugins/CMakeLists.txt
index 1111111..2222222 100644
--- a/plugins/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/plugins/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -283,5 +283,7 @@ REGISTER_IN_PLUGIN("in_emitter")
 REGISTER_IN_PLUGIN("in_tail")
 REGISTER_IN_PLUGIN("in_dummy")
+REGISTER_IN_PLUGIN("in_qnx_proc")
+REGISTER_IN_PLUGIN("in_slog2")
 REGISTER_IN_PLUGIN("in_head")
 REGISTER_IN_PLUGIN("in_health")
 REGISTER_IN_PLUGIN("in_http")
